<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>God the Father dwelling in the Son,</l><l>In the Spirit dwelling, we are all made one;</l><l>God the Son, Accomplisher, the means,</l><l>God the Father, unique source of</l><l>everything!</l></lg>
